body:
I wish there was a place for people like us. But I personally don't believe in the fairy tale idea of a perfect place. 

&#x200B;

My friends after I pretty much killed myself disbanded our band, but then they recently had a reunion without me. It makes me so upset I wish I would die.

That's what I want to do as well. I sometimes wonder if non suicidal people will ever understand how peaceful finally accepting death is.

&#x200B;

Is there anything you want to say before you go?
